    "tque_impl_anchors": "lines 203-250 and 289-327: EnQue SetFlag and DeQue WaitFlag; depth-one queue stores one handle",
    "conclusion": "For BF16 key31 T1024/H16384, j_max=ceil(16384/8192)=2 and each normal worker has rowWork=blockFactor=22. ComputeLatter completes each CopyInX before ComputeY and CopyOutY, then advances the row and tile loops. Each CopyInX issues one 8192-element BF16 DataCopyPad (16384 bytes), EnQue/DeQue performs the MTE2-to-Vector event/wait on a depth-one queue, Cast consumes the tensor, and FreeTensor precedes the next request. Therefore each normal worker executes a serial 2*22=44-request completion chain; the last worker executes 2*12=24 requests."
  },
